<%- include('partials/head') %>
<main id="main">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container heroGrid">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow">Infrastructure without the noise</span>
        <h1>Servers and private connectivity, kept simple.</h1>
        <p class="heroLead">VPS hosting, dedicated servers and VPN access with clear specifications, straightforward GBP pricing and a real person to contact.</p>
        <div class="heroActions"><a class="button" href="/vps">View VPS plans</a><a class="button secondary" href="/contact">Ask a question</a></div>
        <div class="trustRow"><span>UK-based service</span><span>Availability checked first</span><span>Human support</span></div>
      </div>
      <img class="heroArtwork" src="/images/hero-infrastructure.svg" alt="Illustration of connected compute and network infrastructure">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sectionHead"><div><span class="kicker">Choose a service</span><h2>Three products. No maze of options.</h2></div></div>
      <div class="serviceGrid">
        <article class="serviceCard"><img src="/images/vps.svg" alt="Virtual server illustration"><div class="serviceCardBody"><span class="tag">Virtual compute</span><h3>Cloud VPS</h3><p>Flexible NVMe virtual servers for websites, apps, APIs and self-hosted services.</p><a href="/vps">View VPS plans →</a></div></article>
        <article class="serviceCard"><img src="/images/dedicated.svg" alt="Dedicated server illustration"><div class="serviceCardBody"><span class="tag">Bare metal</span><h3>Dedicated servers</h3><p>Physical AMD servers for workloads that need predictable CPU, memory and storage.</p><a href="/dedicated">View dedicated servers →</a></div></article>
        <article class="serviceCard"><img src="/images/vpn.svg" alt="Secure VPN illustration"><div class="serviceCardBody"><span class="tag">Private connectivity</span><h3>Private VPN</h3><p>Encrypted connectivity for personal devices and small teams using established protocols.</p><a href="/vpn">View VPN plans →</a></div></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section sectionMuted">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="kicker">How ordering works</span>
      <h2>Check first. Pay later. Get provisioned.</h2>
      <div class="simpleSteps">
        <article class="simpleStep"><span>01</span><h3>Choose a plan</h3><p>Pick a standard service or tell us the configuration you need.</p></article>
        <article class="simpleStep"><span>02</span><h3>We confirm availability</h3><p>We check stock, region and any material configuration details before payment.</p></article>
        <article class="simpleStep"><span>03</span><h3>Service is provisioned</h3><p>Once the order is accepted, access details are delivered to your contact email.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container simpleTrust">
      <div><strong>Clear service scope</strong><span>Specifications and material limits are shown before an order is accepted.</span></div>
      <div><strong>Independent provider</strong><span>We source capacity through established datacentre and network partners.</span></div>
      <div><strong>One point of contact</strong><span>VPN4U handles your order, provisioning communication and first-line support.</span></div>
      <div><strong>Published policies</strong><span>Terms, privacy, refunds, delivery and acceptable use are available from every page.</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section sectionMuted"><div class="container cta"><div><span class="kicker">Not sure what you need?</span><h2>Tell us what you're trying to run.</h2><p>We can help narrow down CPU, memory, storage, location and network requirements before you order.</p></div><a class="button" href="/contact">Contact VPN4U</a></div></section>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
